From: LieppOS NFC Lab
Subject: [PATCH] nfc: cached lab diagnostics and opt-in ST21 Type4 compatibility

Base: 5b3b95382170fde2d778f8521e6ae3fcbc73307a (Lineage packages/modules/Nfc)
No raw commands, frozen AIDL changes, or default RF enablement.
Operational Type4 access is separately permissioned and build-disabled.

